  "citation": "Zinke P J; Stangenberger A G; Post W M; Emanuel W R; Olson J S (1986): Worldwide Organic Soil Carbon and Nitrogen Data (1986) (NDP-018). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/LUE.NDP018",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
